    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the  world of Dead Don't Die, your mission is to hunt down Elliot Slade - a traitor, a murderer, and maybe even a serial killer. In your way are corrupt gangs and hordes of the undead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense gun and melee combat, with high-stakes. Enemies are smart, use cover, and deal high damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emergent gameplay mechanics mean each combat encounter is unique and no playthrough is quite the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody is infected, and everybody comes back</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Huge arsenal of guns, grenades, RPGs, swords, axes, shields and other items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 characters to choose from, each with their own twist to the story, and unique abilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > AI controlled teammates bring chaos to the battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Physics-based world with high interactivity </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative mechanics for a top-down shooter, like latching zombies you need to shake off, physics doors, and swimming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line of sight and hearing particles - see only what your character can see and see what your character can hear</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the  world of Dead Don't Die, your mission is to hunt down Elliot Slade - a traitor, a murderer, and maybe even a serial killer. In your way are corrupt gangs and hordes of the undead. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense gun and melee combat, with high-stakes. Enemies are smart, use cover, and deal high damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emergent gameplay mechanics mean each combat encounter is unique and no playthrough is quite the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody is infected, and everybody comes back</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Huge arsenal of guns, grenades, RPGs, swords, axes, shields and other items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 characters to choose from, each with their own twist to the story, and unique abilities </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > AI controlled teammates bring chaos to the battlefield</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Physics-based world with high interactivity </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative mechanics for a top-down shooter, like latching zombies you need to shake off, physics doors, and swimming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line of sight and hearing particles - see only what your character can see and see what your character can hear</p></li></ul>",
